  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶、こんな時間までどうしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、お疲れ様、プロデューサー\r\nちょっと……これを見ていたんだ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ドレスのカタログ……\r\nああ、今度のパーティーに着ていくやつか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "まあ、そんなところ……かな",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……何か、悩んでるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "r",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010040",
    "voiceKeep": true
  },
  {
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサーは、このドレスをどう思う？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　……なるほど、\r\nかっこいいし綺麗で、咲耶によく似合いそうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、ありがとう\r\n私も、自分ではそう思ってはいるんだ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "でも……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……何か、ダメな理由があるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……このデザインだと、\r\n靴は高めのハイヒールが合うと思うんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに、その方がかっこよく着こなせそうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だけど、私は背が高いだろう？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "モデルをしていたころならば周りも背が高かったし、\r\nこれくらいでちょうどよかったと思う",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "けれど今回は、\r\nアイドルとしての私、でなくてはいけない",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "では、どのような出で立ちをみんなに求められているのか\r\nそれが果たして私に似合うものなのか……",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "少し、わからなくなってね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ねぇ……アナタは、どうすればいいと思う？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010130"
  },
  {
    "select": "咲耶が\r\n着たいものを着よう",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "咲耶に\r\n似合うものを着よう",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "咲耶はどうしたい？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010140,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それってつまり……\r\nこのドレス、ということかい？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。咲耶が最初に惹かれたものなんだ\r\n俺も、そのドレスがいいと思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "しかし……\r\nアイドルとして相応しいかどうか……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もし、本当にアイドルとしての咲耶に\r\nよくないと思ったら俺は止める",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_a",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなこと、これから先もきっとないけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……だから、俺を信じるってことで、\r\n考えてみてくれないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……クス\r\nありがとう、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだね\r\nもう少し、私は私を……自分自身を信じてみるよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……アナタが、私を信じてくれているようにね",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010190"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "せっかく咲耶というアイドルがいるんだ\r\n咲耶の魅力を一番引き立てるものを着るべきだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "しかし、いくら私に似合っていたとしても\r\nアイドルとして、場にそぐわないようでは……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "他のアイドルが着こなせないかもしれないドレスを\r\n着こなすのも、かっこいいと思うぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……かっこいい、のかい？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、誰よりも輝いている咲耶の姿に\r\nきっとみんな喜んでくれるはずだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……フフ。そうだね、私が望んでいるのは\r\n何よりもみんなに喜んでもらうことだから……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それに、パーティーに呼んでもらったからには\r\n一番良い私を見せないとね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、その通りだ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それならば、早速……私が決めたこのドレスに\r\nピッタリな靴を探そうじゃないか！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ドレスと私の魅力を、最大限に引き出してくれる\r\n最高に素敵な靴をね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010250"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010260,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私は……みんなに喜んでもらえるものがいいな\r\nだから……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それなら、もう答えは出ているじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010270,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "えっ……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "みんなに一番喜んでもらえる咲耶は\r\n一番自由に笑っている咲耶なんだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、咲耶は咲耶が思ったままに\r\n行動したらいい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010280,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010290,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス。アナタの言葉を聞くと、悩んでいた自分が\r\nとても愚かしく思えるよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010300,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "でも……ありがとう\r\nアナタのおかげで、決心したよ",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006007010310,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "いかなる時も\r\n私は私らしくあろう、とね",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600701/2006007010310"
  },
  {
